ix are not in the record yet.","Not a gate: an input to CONF-A3-001's campaign record (HO-D2)."],"r12Extensions":{"cases":["CK-04","CV-04","DD-04"],"note":"R12-authored cases (VIS-C15-SPLIT conditions 1-4): never conformance to the merged record's 13 vectors; their expected arms are R12's until the record's successor rules, and then the case follows the record (HO-D2)."},"residuals":{"DD-04":["backup copies until their retention ends","exports delivered before the erasure","opaque references to the erased record, not disclosed by default"]},"role":"an input to the campaign record, not a gate (HO-D2)","schemaVersion":"r12.data-correctness-campaign-record/v1"}
